m Japanese cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Makimura, is a Michelin 3-star kappo kaiseki restaurant in Shinagawa, Japan run by chef Akio Makimura. Due to its small size and since there is only one seating per night which usually only has locals, the restaurant is also known for how difficult it is to get a reservation. The restaurant has been open for over 25 years but has been in its current location since May 10, 2010. The closest metro is Ōmorikaigan Station"]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-makimura"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Makimura"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Japanese cuisine","cuisine/japanese-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Just One Cookbook","ref":"site/justonecookbook-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"justonecookbook.com","note":"Namiko Chen's long-running blog and videos on Japanese home cooking.","url":"https://justonecookbook.com","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"RecipeTin Japan","ref":"site/japan-recipetineats-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"japan.recipetineats.com","note":"Japanese home recipes from Yumiko, a Japan-born cook, sister site to RecipeTin Eats.","url":"https://japan.recipetineats.com/","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Japanese cuisine","links":[["Benihana","dish/benihana"],["Bergh–Stoutenburgh House","dish/bergh-stoutenburgh-house"],["Bincho","dish/bincho"],["Boxer Ramen","dish/boxer-ramen"],["Cagen","dish/cagen"],["Chikuwa","dish/chikuwa"],["Curry bread","dish/curry-bread"],["Donburi","dish/donburi"],["Em (restaurant)","dish/em-restaurant"],["Esaki (restaurant)","dish/esaki-restaurant"],["Feng Sushi","dish/feng-sushi"],["Freshness Burger","dish/freshness-burger"],["Fukamushicha","dish/fukamushicha"],["Gyokuro","dish/gyokuro"],["Heihachi Jaya","dish/heihachi-jaya"],["Hitsumabushi","dish/hitsumabushi"],["HokBen","dish/hokben"],["Hokka Hokka Tei","dish/hokka-hokka-tei"],["Horumonyaki","dish/horumonyaki"]